WEBVTT

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:14.540
Once, in times when humans and
demons mingled and coexisted,

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:19.450
a human princess was abducted by the
demon king and imprisoned in his Demon Castle.

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:24.200
The only one who could save her was the hero.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:26.870
However, the hero's journey
was fraught with danger,

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:30.080
and he engaged in countless
seesaw battles with demons.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:33.450
While the demons, who waited
in anticipation, let their guards down.

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:44.950
They never suspected that
someone would steal from them.

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:52.700
Demon King!

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:53.990
What is it?

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:55.740
The princess is gone from her cell again.

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:59.120
Again? What's she making this time?

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:01.990
Something's wrong.
I can't find her anywhere in the castle.

00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:05.830
She's not in the forest nor at the lake!

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:06.830
What?!

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:10.290
A letter?

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:15.700
"I've stolen your human princess"?!

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:17.240
What the--?!

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:53.040
"Seventh Night"
"Even More Sleepless Princess of the Castle"

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:57.040
Former Demon Castle

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:06.040
Where am I?

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:14.540
So you've awoken, O trembling princess.

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:14.540
Hades

00:03:16.910 --> 00:03:19.240
The princess was abducted?!

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:22.700
Keep your voice down!
There will be chaos if it's made public.

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:26.790
O-Oh, right. But who did it?

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:29.620
This looks like Hades' handwriting.

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:32.060
Hades' Younger Brother

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:32.330
Bro?

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:36.910
He's an insurgent who has the strength
and ruthlessness of the top ten.

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:40.200
I don't want to be involved.

00:03:41.370 --> 00:03:43.490
Hey, wait, Poseidon!

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:46.080
Leave him be.

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:47.950
As you wish.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:50.200
Well, what does Hades want?

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:56.330
Right... "To the greenhorn Twilight who only
became the demon king due to pedigree,

00:03:56.330 --> 00:04:00.910
As you twiddle your thumbs,
<i>I</i> will mount a counterattack at the hero

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:07.910
and become the true demon king! Just you wait."

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:12.120
That impertinent Hades.
He thinks he can seize your throne?

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:26.120
Twilight's castle defenses are
so vulnerable compared to this castle.

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:28.330
This is the last place you'll
ever be imprisoned.

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:31.290
You'll never set foot beyond these walls again.

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:35.740
Seems I've left you speechless.
How I must terrify you, Princess.

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:38.580
Tremble in fear as you await your hero!

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:53.700
There's nothing to do other than sleep.

00:04:56.790 --> 00:05:02.950
Seems I switched prisons in my sleep.

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:04.990
But look at the state of this place.

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:08.540
I wish he were a bit more
considerate of my needs.

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:13.740
Fortunately, this castle's
quieter than the other one.

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:17.240
I'll think more on this after a nap...

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:24.240
What a dismally cheap pillow!

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:28.540
Yet again. Must I do this yet again?

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:33.040
Is a good night's rest that hard to come by?

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:36.410
Then... I'll have to make it myself!

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:40.160
"Quest"

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:40.160
"Refashion Pillow"

00:05:40.290 --> 00:05:42.870
Hey, human princess!

00:05:42.870 --> 00:05:45.040
We're Hades' number one underlings!

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:48.990
--Ker!
--Ber!
--Ros!

00:05:52.830 --> 00:05:57.370
We heard about a new prisoner,
so we came to laugh at your miserable face.

00:06:06.410 --> 00:06:07.740
Say...

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:09.120
R-Run!

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:13.950
Where can I find materials for a pillow?

00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:21.980
Hades' Younger Brother Meanwhile, at the Demon Castle

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:18.790
Demon King, what is your plan?

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:20.790
Connect me to the Former Demon Castle!

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:21.790
At once!

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:27.830
Look who it is, the <i>former</i> demon king.

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:29.740
How dare--

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:32.910
Hades! Return our prisoner!

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:35.910
You mean that quivering princess?

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:39.990
If you want her back, it's only proper
for you to come here and steal her back.

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:46.580
So sheltered.
Clueless, even about your situation.

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:55.160
What's wrong?
Has frustration rendered you speechless?

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:57.410
Huh? Uh, well...

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:01.950
Where'd your boldness go?

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:04.620
I-Is she really...

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:04.620
You look pathetic.

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:05.620
Will she do it?!

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:12.410
What are you all shouting for--

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:15.620
I-It's nothing! Just felt like it suddenly!

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:17.620
Right? Right?

00:07:17.620 --> 00:07:20.240
That's right! I felt a sudden urge to shout!

00:07:23.120 --> 00:07:25.950
My shoulders are in knots!

00:07:25.950 --> 00:07:29.290
My shoulders knotted up, too!

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:31.950
Stop this fooling around!

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:34.540
This is bad! The fur she's ripping is circular!

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:35.010
Won't come off

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:37.620
What can we do?!

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:42.950
O-Oh, no! Hades, above you!
There's something above you!

00:07:42.950 --> 00:07:43.520
Say what?!

00:07:43.520 --> 00:07:45.660
You must levitate to get it!

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:46.700
Oh!

00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:48.290
Good thinking, Alraune!

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:49.790
Above?

00:07:49.790 --> 00:07:51.450
Princess! Now's your chance!

00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:52.910
All right!

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:55.490
Yeah!

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:01.870
--She did it!
--Thanks!

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:03.040
Demons' excitement on par
with a successful rocket launch

00:08:03.240 --> 00:08:05.330
Hey.

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:06.700
There was nothing up there.

00:08:09.160 --> 00:08:10.040
What?

00:08:10.040 --> 00:08:12.540
Nothing!

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:14.160
Nothing whatsoever!

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:23.740
I have acquired materials
for a peaceful slumber!

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:32.120
First, I'll wrap the fur I tore off
around this dismal pillow

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:34.870
to give it structure.

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:39.990
Then, I'll wrap it with the cloth
that was attached to the fur.

00:08:39.990 --> 00:08:44.370
And as a princess, I must add these
cute bows as a finishing touch.

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:51.540
It's done! Refashioning Gives Hope
to the Hopeless Pillow!

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:59.510
Quest Complete

00:08:57.240 --> 00:08:58.540
Well done!

00:08:59.990 --> 00:09:06.790
I don't know where I am,
but I must be tired from the journey.

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:11.790
For now, I'll sleep on this blissful pillow.

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:14.830
Zzz...

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:24.410
The Demon Castle's rather quiet today.

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:25.410
Yeah.

00:09:26.540 --> 00:09:27.870
When did this happen?!

00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:33.050
Ker, Ber, Ros

00:09:28.990 --> 00:09:30.830
<i>Sleepy Princess in the</i> (former) <i>Demon Castle</i> !

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:40.830
This new castle is quiet.

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:44.870
Comes with three meals a day
with large meat portions.

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:49.830
But this room is an absolute dump.

00:09:51.910 --> 00:09:55.580
I slept last night thanks
to my refashioned pillow,

00:09:55.580 --> 00:09:58.410
but that was a temporary measure.

00:09:58.410 --> 00:10:01.160
Which means I have to make this, too!

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:05.200
"Quest"

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:05.200
"Bed for Peaceful Slumber"

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:12.660
Why are the traps so numerous?

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:14.840
"Spikes!!"

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:16.340
"Axes!!"

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:17.970
"Fireballs!!"

00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:21.200
Have they no concern for ordinary living space?!

00:10:21.490 --> 00:10:22.720
Former Demon Castle

00:10:22.410 --> 00:10:24.830
I-Is that the prisoner walking about?!

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:27.240
Yeah, right.

00:10:27.240 --> 00:10:33.120
It can't only be me. The demons must
have a hard time sleeping here, too.

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:39.790
Zzz...

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:50.160
He's sleeping so peacefully despite
the craggy ground and flames below.

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:51.790
Just who is he?

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:57.870
But I'd have to disturb his slumber
to find out, which I couldn't do...

00:11:00.130 --> 00:11:02.660
Wake me when the bell rings

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:16.240
I was wondering who woke me.

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:19.450
I didn't expect you, our captive princess.

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:22.790
I'm called Hypnos.

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:22.200
Hypnos

00:11:22.790 --> 00:11:24.830
H-Hypnos?!

00:11:24.830 --> 00:11:28.330
Though, I don't have the ability
to put people to sleep.

00:11:28.330 --> 00:11:30.910
I'm more like the embodiment of drowsiness.

00:11:30.910 --> 00:11:33.910
I'll perish without at least
20 hours of sleep a day,

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:37.040
so I research methods on how to sleep anywhere.

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:39.410
O-Oh, my!

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:42.910
He's a... pro sleeper!

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:44.220
<i>Pro</i>

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:44.220
<i>Pro</i>

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:48.540
For example, why am I sleeping
in a place like this?

00:11:48.540 --> 00:11:51.370
Oh, you wouldn't be interested--

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:52.410
Continue.

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:53.200
Huh?

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:55.290
Continue, Master Hypnos!

00:11:55.290 --> 00:11:58.700
<i>Master</i> Hypnos, huh?

00:11:58.700 --> 00:12:05.120
It's simple. This is the only area on
this floor fireballs don't pass through.

00:12:06.070 --> 00:12:08.200
Out of range

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:08.240
I see.

00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:10.910
It's a thank you for waking me.

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:13.790
Plus, I'll tell you something extra special.

00:12:17.790 --> 00:12:18.740
Hey!

00:12:18.740 --> 00:12:19.660
Hm?

00:12:19.660 --> 00:12:21.910
Was the princess really abducted last night?

00:12:21.910 --> 00:12:23.200
That's what I heard.

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:25.410
They're planning countermeasures
in a meeting now.

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:28.120
It just had to be the Former Demon Castle, huh?

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:30.740
That ruin is jam-packed with traps.

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:33.540
The demons who stayed there
are mostly weirdos, too.

00:12:33.540 --> 00:12:36.290
Even our princess will have trouble there.

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:39.240
I hope she stays safe.

00:12:39.240 --> 00:12:40.290
Yeah...

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:49.740
You see this electrified floor?

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:50.790
You can...

00:12:52.490 --> 00:12:56.290
...flip the tile over
so it won't shock you.

00:12:57.490 --> 00:12:58.660
Ooh!

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:04.330
All the electrified floor does
is amplify this fur's static electricity.

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:06.550
Power
source

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:06.580
O-Oh, my!

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:07.580
Here.

00:13:08.950 --> 00:13:14.620
I was so ignorant!
I was too blessed in my environment.

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:18.950
To think that a trap floor could be
turned into bedding this way!

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:23.570
Biting Battery Pack (Power Source)

00:13:21.790 --> 00:13:23.830
Which means...

00:13:23.830 --> 00:13:29.740
But it'll paralyze you if you're not careful.
You should tread carefull--

00:13:29.200 --> 00:13:31.830
Already destroyed
power source

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:31.790
Hey!

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:34.200
Oh, no! Destroying that will trigger traps--

00:13:34.200 --> 00:13:35.200
Spikes.

00:13:38.490 --> 00:13:39.830
Axe.

00:13:39.830 --> 00:13:40.830
What?!

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:44.490
Fireballs.

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:47.700
What are you doing?!

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:51.950
Hey!

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:59.040
Now I can flip this floor in no time.

00:13:56.850 --> 00:14:00.190
Mental image

00:14:02.370 --> 00:14:05.910
She carries such passion for sleep!

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:07.040
She's got talent!

00:14:07.450 --> 00:14:08.950
Nobody there
to retort

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:13.240
We will now make preparations
to retrieve our prisoner!

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:17.040
The Former Demon Castle
is a harsh place, even for us.

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:18.830
The captive must be suffering!

00:14:22.580 --> 00:14:25.790
She's transforming the electric floor
to bedding with fearsome speed!

00:14:26.420 --> 00:14:27.990
Prisoner

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:30.370
The Former Demon Castle has many traps.

00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:33.410
Permission to use a comforter
to shield the prisoner!

00:14:33.410 --> 00:14:37.370
Granted! Injury to the prisoner
is injury to the demon king's honor!

00:14:43.410 --> 00:14:44.580
Those are--

00:14:44.580 --> 00:14:48.790
Sh-She's even using sliding floor traps?!

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:52.370
Prisoner

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:55.870
The prisoner may be feeling anxious!

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:58.540
Permission for Teddy Demons to accompany us!

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:00.080
Permission granted for up to ten!

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:02.910
Prisoner

00:15:03.290 --> 00:15:09.790
It's done! This is my new bed,
Mobile Electric Floor Deluxe!

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:12.700
A-Absurd! It's much too large!

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:14.620
It's a fireball target at that size--

00:15:17.910 --> 00:15:22.830
Is this why she made it mobile?!
And why she built a path?!

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:30.580
My goodness. She learned and
utilized my teachings so quickly.

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:36.620
With more instruction, she can grow
her talent for sleep even further!

00:15:36.620 --> 00:15:43.080
Rest is something you seize using
your own effort wherever you may be.

00:15:44.990 --> 00:15:46.290
Zzz...

00:15:48.090 --> 00:15:55.600
Quest Complete

00:15:52.990 --> 00:15:54.450
Well done!

00:15:55.700 --> 00:15:58.160
I found a new pupil who sleeps well.

00:15:59.990 --> 00:16:02.490
Are you all prepared?!

00:16:02.490 --> 00:16:06.120
We will now commence our operation
to reclaim our prisoner!

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:07.120
Yes!

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:13.990
Hades

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:11.660
<i>Sleepy Princess in the</i> (former) <i>Demon Castle</i> .

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:17.160
It's come into view.

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:18.410
Let us hurry.

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:19.410
Yeah.

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:27.330
Not long now.

00:16:33.080 --> 00:16:34.620
Where am I?

00:16:34.620 --> 00:16:38.410
Right, I fell asleep in this strange room

00:16:38.410 --> 00:16:41.410
Escaped cell, as usual

00:16:38.410 --> 00:16:41.410
while looking for bedding.

00:16:42.240 --> 00:16:44.740
I had planned to inspect objects

00:16:44.740 --> 00:16:50.080
that don't at first appear as
likely bedding, as Master taught me.

00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:52.490
I'm off to bed.

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:56.620
Then I found this closet heaping
with these ridiculous furs.

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:59.740
How could I resist sleeping here?

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:06.370
That aside, whoever owns these
must wear this gaudy fur every day.

00:17:06.370 --> 00:17:10.740
I should be thankful for their horrendous
fashion sense, whoever it is.

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:10.300
Collects

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:14.330
All right. Time to assemble
another comfortable bed today.

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:19.050
"Quest"
"Sleep Comfortably Once More"

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:21.410
Hades!

00:17:22.950 --> 00:17:26.160
I know.

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:28.870
Twilight... He's here, huh?

00:17:28.870 --> 00:17:31.040
Looks like he brought some others.

00:17:32.740 --> 00:17:35.620
He's got a nice gleam in his eye.

00:17:35.620 --> 00:17:40.080
But no matter how much he shouts,
I won't back down.

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:42.410
Princess!

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:44.700
Princess! I've got candy!

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:45.950
Come out!

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:48.540
Hm?

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:54.200
Princess! Don't you want to sleep
with this nice comforter?

00:17:54.200 --> 00:17:57.040
Look, Princess! Teddy Demons!

00:17:57.040 --> 00:17:58.660
Come out and I'll let you hold them!

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:04.290
Look at all these sweets I have!

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:08.290
I see, they must be afraid of me.

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:08.290
Princess! Here's some yummy candy!

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:12.540
They must be plotting take the prisoner
and leave without fighting me.

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:12.540
Where are you? Come out!

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:17.450
But that won't work. She's imprisoned.

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:20.410
She won't come out
just because they call for her.

00:18:25.990 --> 00:18:30.790
Hey, Ker, Ber, and Ros.
Go check in on Twilight--

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:33.660
We didn't know that
Great Red Siberian would be here!

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:34.660
I'm scared.

00:18:34.660 --> 00:18:36.040
I wet myself.

00:18:36.040 --> 00:18:38.040
Stupid runty dogs!

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:40.200
There's nothing to be scared of.

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:43.580
Have you forgotten about
the items I've stocked for you?

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:44.830
Oh, right!

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:47.990
Let's see, there's the
Mana Hat that doubles your MP!

00:18:48.870 --> 00:18:49.600
Dismantled

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:51.620
And Gigantify Seeds that make you grow huge!

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:53.110
Merge

00:18:53.040 --> 00:18:56.410
And the Devil's Whip
that never misses its target!

00:18:57.370 --> 00:18:59.620
Made a neck pillow

00:18:59.620 --> 00:19:03.950
Plus we've got... <i>that</i> item for aerial warfare!

00:19:03.950 --> 00:19:05.580
What is this thing?

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:16.160
We finally meet.

00:19:18.740 --> 00:19:22.290
Today's your last day as demon king.

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:24.040
Woof!

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:30.160
I can't believe it. I was sure we'd lure
her out with bedding, candy, and teddies.

00:19:30.160 --> 00:19:32.040
This was unforeseen.

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:35.080
Perhaps we should've
brought Eggplant Seals, too.

00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:39.740
What the hell did you guys come here for?

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:40.830
A foolish question.

00:19:46.370 --> 00:19:47.740
Now that's more like it!

00:19:48.740 --> 00:19:50.120
It's about to start at last!

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:01.200
The battle for the throne of the demon king!

00:20:03.740 --> 00:20:04.870
Here I come!

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:05.950
Go!

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:12.640
Bound for Demon Castle

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:16.120
P... Princess!

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:18.240
Over there! There she is!

00:20:18.240 --> 00:20:21.990
--Princess! You're safe!
--She's truly a scary girl.

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:24.450
--Hey!
--Come back!

00:20:24.450 --> 00:20:26.830
Hey, what about our battle?!

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:28.990
Put it on hold!

00:20:30.990 --> 00:20:32.950
--Princess!
--Princess!

00:20:32.950 --> 00:20:35.040
--Wait!
--Princess!

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:37.910
I think I hear some voices...

00:20:37.910 --> 00:20:41.740
As I thought, I don't sleep well when I travel.

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:43.540
I got a good haul, though.

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:56.080
Let's go home... to the Demon Castle.

00:20:56.080 --> 00:21:00.370
Where my bed is arranged to my liking.

00:21:00.370 --> 00:21:05.160
But until we get back,
I'll journey through the sky

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:08.040
sleeping on the materials I gathered on my trip.

00:21:10.240 --> 00:21:11.540
Zzz...

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:21.460
Quest Complete

00:21:18.740 --> 00:21:20.120
Well done!

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:25.220
<i>New map area added</i>

00:21:23.490 --> 00:21:25.220
<i>Former Demon Castle</i>

00:21:25.040 --> 00:21:28.540
Don't think you can get away with this!

00:21:28.540 --> 00:21:30.450
Come again soon.

00:21:30.450 --> 00:21:35.370
--Princess!
--Wait!
--Wait for us!

00:21:35.370 --> 00:21:37.830
What was the point of us going...

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:38.310
Shh!

00:21:37.830 --> 00:21:39.290
Princess!

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:51.740
It was super quiet while
the princess was gone, huh?

00:21:51.740 --> 00:21:53.870
Yeah, I was kinda bored.

00:21:53.870 --> 00:21:58.950
She willingly came back on her own this time
because her abductor was a demon.

00:21:58.950 --> 00:22:01.330
If the hero were to come...

00:23:42.740 --> 00:23:45.620
It's true when they say that good
things come to those who wait.

00:23:45.620 --> 00:23:48.740
The Teddy Demons came to me
when I waited patiently.

00:23:48.740 --> 00:23:51.830
I have no need for Master Hypno's teachings now.

00:23:51.830 --> 00:23:54.830
Next time, "The Princess and
the Frightful Demon Nightmare."

00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:56.240
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .
